    "2025 step change: platform nights 8,644,420 vs 4,400,084 in 2024 (+96%). Likely a coverage/onboarding change in the EC platform agreement rather than true market growth; treat the 2025 share (29.80 %) with caution and re-verify against the next Eurostat release before policy use.",
